	<VirtualInstrument Id="1" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/LabVIEW.VI">
		<p.UserDescription xmlns="http://www.ni.com/PlatformFramework">This VI is the splash screen and launcher for the full-featured user interface. It performs the following operations:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;1. Opens reference to itself to pass to Full UI - Top-Level VI.vi. That VI will close the panel of this VI after it shows its own panel.&lt;br/&gt;2. Opens and runs runs Full UI - Top-Level VI.vi. This is done dynamically to improve the launch time of the application.&lt;br/&gt;3. Waits until Full UI - Top-Level VI.vi completes and closes the reference to that VI.&lt;br/&gt;4. If the VI is not running in a built application, reopens its panel.&lt;br/&gt;5. Closes the reference to itself.&lt;br/&gt;6. If the VI is running in a built application, exits the application.</p.UserDescription>
